{"2835650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Randomice", "steam_appid": 2835650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3958470], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomice is Metroid-like… randomized. Usually, important items are always in the same place, and you collect powers in a predetermined order. But here, everything is randomly redistributed throughout the world. As a result, you never know what you're going to find or in what order you're going to explore the rooms of the house.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/extras/cd7e3c856c68b0a58008cbe906685cea.poster.avif?t=1773065036\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/extras/cd7e3c856c68b0a58008cbe906685cea.webm?t=1773065036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/extras/cd7e3c856c68b0a58008cbe906685cea.mp4?t=1773065036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adapt to what you find</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the items are randomly placed, each game creates a different adventure. You have to constantly adapt, improvise, and make the most of what you find. This is what gives the game such high replay value.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape the lab</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This idea is also integrated into the game's lore. Every time you think you've found the exit, you wake up in a laboratory cage. But you're not alone! Kimo, another mouse locked up with you, has managed to find a remote control that allows you to change certain parameters of the experiment in order to find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/extras/4f4efd3b7d68be5fe75949f4a5b463b0.poster.avif?t=1773065036\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/extras/4f4efd3b7d68be5fe75949f4a5b463b0.webm?t=1773065036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/extras/4f4efd3b7d68be5fe75949f4a5b463b0.mp4?t=1773065036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shuffle everything!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, changing these settings is not without risk. Every day, Kimo will try something new. First, he'll mix up all the rooms in the house, then the next day he'll move where each mouse is, and it can even change what objects they ask for! Each variation of these settings creates a different configuration of the house, for an increasingly challenging game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Need help?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there's no need to worry, Randomice offers a campaign that serves as an introduction to the concept of randomizers. If at some point you don’t know where to go, you can always ask Vyna for a hint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/extras/36dfa99aa9826bba3b2ee4278c5305c6.poster.avif?t=1773065036\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/extras/36dfa99aa9826bba3b2ee4278c5305c6.webm?t=1773065036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/extras/36dfa99aa9826bba3b2ee4278c5305c6.mp4?t=1773065036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Come on in!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make yourself at home! Find the push pins to scale the wooden cabinets, the magnetic grapple to cling to the metal pot, or the rocket to fly across the garage at breakneck speed! Each new piece of equipment will help you access new corners of the house, bringing you a little closer to freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/extras/fc2ba8f7b1981ff688f9f7ccd5dde640.poster.avif?t=1773065036\" width=600 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/extras/fc2ba8f7b1981ff688f9f7ccd5dde640.webm?t=1773065036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/extras/fc2ba8f7b1981ff688f9f7ccd5dde640.mp4?t=1773065036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 10 hours of playtime to complete the campaign<br>- 14 different upgrades, placed randomly each time<br>- 14 rooms to explore<br>- 20 characters with unique quests<br>- 12 base challenges + 12 monthly challenges planned throughout 2026<br>- 50 Steam achievements<br>- A Soundtrack played mostly with real instruments</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomice is Metroid-like… randomized. Usually, important items are always in the same place, and you collect powers in a predetermined order. But here, everything is randomly redistributed throughout the world. As a result, you never know what you're going to find or in what order you're going to explore the rooms of the house.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/extras/cd7e3c856c68b0a58008cbe906685cea.poster.avif?t=1773065036\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/extras/cd7e3c856c68b0a58008cbe906685cea.webm?t=1773065036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/extras/cd7e3c856c68b0a58008cbe906685cea.mp4?t=1773065036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adapt to what you find</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the items are randomly placed, each game creates a different adventure. You have to constantly adapt, improvise, and make the most of what you find. This is what gives the game such high replay value.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape the lab</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This idea is also integrated into the game's lore. Every time you think you've found the exit, you wake up in a laboratory cage. But you're not alone! Kimo, another mouse locked up with you, has managed to find a remote control that allows you to change certain parameters of the experiment in order to find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/extras/4f4efd3b7d68be5fe75949f4a5b463b0.poster.avif?t=1773065036\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/extras/4f4efd3b7d68be5fe75949f4a5b463b0.webm?t=1773065036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/extras/4f4efd3b7d68be5fe75949f4a5b463b0.mp4?t=1773065036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shuffle everything!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, changing these settings is not without risk. Every day, Kimo will try something new. First, he'll mix up all the rooms in the house, then the next day he'll move where each mouse is, and it can even change what objects they ask for! Each variation of these settings creates a different configuration of the house, for an increasingly challenging game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Need help?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there's no need to worry, Randomice offers a campaign that serves as an introduction to the concept of randomizers. If at some point you don’t know where to go, you can always ask Vyna for a hint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/extras/36dfa99aa9826bba3b2ee4278c5305c6.poster.avif?t=1773065036\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/extras/36dfa99aa9826bba3b2ee4278c5305c6.webm?t=1773065036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/extras/36dfa99aa9826bba3b2ee4278c5305c6.mp4?t=1773065036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Come on in!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make yourself at home! Find the push pins to scale the wooden cabinets, the magnetic grapple to cling to the metal pot, or the rocket to fly across the garage at breakneck speed! Each new piece of equipment will help you access new corners of the house, bringing you a little closer to freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/extras/fc2ba8f7b1981ff688f9f7ccd5dde640.poster.avif?t=1773065036\" width=600 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/extras/fc2ba8f7b1981ff688f9f7ccd5dde640.webm?t=1773065036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/extras/fc2ba8f7b1981ff688f9f7ccd5dde640.mp4?t=1773065036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 10 hours of playtime to complete the campaign<br>- 14 different upgrades, placed randomly each time<br>- 14 rooms to explore<br>- 20 characters with unique quests<br>- 12 base challenges + 12 monthly challenges planned throughout 2026<br>- 50 Steam achievements<br>- A Soundtrack played mostly with real instruments</p>", "short_description": "Escape from a laboratory house in this unique puzzling platformer with a twist! All important objects are randomly placed in the world before the start of the game. Each playthrough will take a different path through the house, but can always be completed. A perfect introduction to Randomizers.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/b76c8c600c7eddfc4544dd51af256df64862ec10/header.jpg?t=1773065036", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/465444b91a07862a0f07f738a7f8db29b58208c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773065036", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835650/465444b91a07862a0f07f738a7f8db29b58208c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773065036", "website": "https://randomice.miraheze.org/wiki/Main_Page", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E5200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 9800GTX+<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Add